# Whitelist only: this repo is public and sits inside a workspace that also
# holds key material, payout ledgers and build output. Nothing is added unless
# it is listed below. `*` ignores every file and directory; the `!` lines are
# the complete set of dashboard sources and nothing else.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/RUNBOOK.md
!/wrangler.jsonc
!/check_sources.py

# CI.
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/check_shell_bytes.py
!/.github/workflows/dashboard.yml
!/.github/workflows/live-check.yaml

# Directories must be unignored before any file inside them can be.
!/build/
!/build/web/
!/build/web/assets/

# Build tooling and the worker.
!/build/check_live.py
!/build/check_site_worker.mjs
!/build/make_site_fiatlord.py
!/build/site-fiatlord.deploy.json
!/build/site-fiatlord.schema.sql
!/build/site-fiatlord.worker.js
!/build/worker-id.mjs

# Staged site inputs (only what index.html references).
!/build/web/ads.html
!/build/web/ads.js
!/build/web/index.html
!/build/web/assets/index-6o21nwvo.css
!/build/web/assets/index-87a7946b18f5.js

# The maintenance pipeline, and the tests that hold its review and drift paths to
# drafting only. A test file on its own is not coverage: each one imports the module
# it covers, so a clone without these four would stop at collection. Credentials are
# read from .env at run time; nothing in them is a key, a ledger or a build product.
!/x10_ai.py
!/x10_agent.py
!/x10_deploy.py
!/x10_fuse.py
!/test_x10_ai_review.py
!/test_x10_agent.py
# The live check's own regression test: it drives build/check_live.py against a
# local host, so it belongs with the check rather than with the pipeline tests.
!/test_check_live_undeployed.py
!/requirements.txt
